text = "Your flashlight cuts through the darkness in a beam too thin to be comforting. You go from door to door, passing examination rooms and broom closets until you reach a space that's been turned upside down. Every cabinet has been pulled open, and cracked pill bottles and smashed first-aid kits litter the floor. At first glance, it looks hopeless, but after some searching, you find a few useful things.

+3 SUPPLIES"
